      "text": "THEIR RELATIONSHIP:\n  Innate activates adaptive (DCs present antigen to T cells)\n  Adaptive refines innate (IgG opsonizes → macrophages phagocytose)\n  Innate provides context (danger signals → adaptive priming)\n```"
